    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκᾰτοστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hundredth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.47
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἑκατοστὰ
			ἐκφέρειν</span> to bear <i>a hundredfold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.198
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατοστή, ἡ,</span>
